## How to Run

### Development Mode
```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
cd server-rack-layout/backend
npm install
node src/index.js

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd server-rack-layout/frontend
npm install
npx vite --port 3080
```
Open http://localhost:3080 · Login: `admin / admin123`

### Docker
```bash
cd server-rack-layout
docker-compose up --build
```
Open http://localhost:3080

